---

This project is a port of PostCSS (https://github.com/postcss/postcss), which is
also MIT licensed:

  Copyright 2013 Andrey Sitnik <andrey@sitnik.ru>

The Rust crate (src/) is an independent implementation. The npm package's JS
layer is not: the files listed at the top of node/lib/*.js as "taken from
PostCSS" are PostCSS's own object model, included under the licence above so that
plugins see exactly the API they were written against. The Rust core supplies
parsing, stringification, source maps and tokenizing behind it.

Test fixtures under tests/fixtures/cases are copied from postcss-parser-tests;
see tests/fixtures/LICENSE-postcss-parser-tests.
